  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity under preparation EU ASEAN Green Partnerships</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The purpose of the planned contract is to implement the `EU ASEAN Green Partnerships&#xBF; component of the EU-ASEAN Green Initiative through a call for proposals. This initiative is covered by the Commission Implementing Decision of 16 December 2021 on the financing of the multiannual action plan in favour of the Asia region for 2021-2022.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The overall objective of the call is to strengthen partnerships with and between a wide range of actors including civil society organisations (CSOs), city authorities and youth on climate action, environmental protection and disaster risk reduction (DRR). This will be achieved by:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1) Creating opportunities for EU and ASEAN organisations to share experiences and cooperate on advocacy;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;2) Creating digital youth environmental education programmes adjusted to the needs of ASEAN Member States.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
